# Runtime session ledgers written at the repository root. Anchored: the
# unanchored `sessions/` also matched rust/cli/reports/sessions/, so the split
# of the session commands (bc01c61) committed the deletion of sessions.rs and
# silently left its five replacement modules out of Git.
/sessions/
